.TH SETPGID 3crunch "" "Crunch" "Crunch Library Manual"
.SH NAME
setpgid \- sets the process group for a process, subject to linux session and permission rules
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B #include <unistd.h>
.B int setpgid(pid_t process, pid_t group);
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
Sets the process group for a process, subject to Linux session and permission rules.
.SH RETURN VALUE
Returns the syscall result on success, or \-1 with errno set.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR setpgid (2)
